SUMMARY:Greenwood North - After Work Hike\, Intermediate
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nOur first After Work hike of the season. T
 his will be a faster hike. We will hike at a moderate pace for 5 - 6 km in
  2 hrs or less. I have moved this hike to April 14th as this hiking trail 
 may still have some icy sections. Bring along your ice cleats just in case
  there is more ice than expected. We should be done before nightfall but a
  flashlight may be a good idea as well. Lets start getting in shape for su
 mmer.\n\nThe trail weaves through the forest and along a creek. There will
  be twists and turns and ups and downs but nothig serious. This event is a
 bout enjoying a hike at night.\n\n**Note**\n• Arrive on time! Don't let 
 the group wait for you.\n• Know your limits! Hike within it!\n• Dress 
 for the conditions.\n• Free Parking\n• No Dogs\n• The hike will be c
 anceled if the weather doesn't cooperate.\n\n***Hike leaves promptly at 5:
 37 PM***\n\nHope to see you there!\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INF
 ORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and paying the event fee (if applicable)\, you 
 are confirming that you have read\, understand and accept the following:\n
 \n1. GTA Hiking Meetup is a private group. Attending events is voluntary b
 y you as a member. Participation in any activity with us is at your own ri
 sk.\n2. By joining this event as a member you agree to indemnify and hold 
 harmless its organizers\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, event hos
 ts\, and other members from all claims or liability of every type (includi
 ng court costs and legal fees) for injury or death to any person or for da
 mage to property\, loss of personal property or any other wrongful act ari
 sing out of or relating to your participation as a member. This agreement 
 applies to you and to other persons (as your guests) who may accompany you
  in these endeavors.\n3. You also agree to hold the organizers as well as 
 other group members harmless. By participating voluntarily in the group\, 
 you expressly waive any and all such claims against each and every other m
 ember in the group\, including without limitation any and all claims again
 st the group organizer\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, and event 
